     Gail was correct when she suggested late yesterday that my geometry
was probably wrong and that FDBETA was probably correct.  Let us try the
new geoinp.f which calls FTRANG.  You will need to add FTRANG to the
makefile (it does not include PARAM.LST).  Also, I added debug write
statements in lower case to FDBETA yesterday; please remove them.

     Below I include the FTRANG routine, the new GEOINP routine and all
other routines that have been modified since OCT 15 (PHASEF, DPRFPA,
BMOD, SOLZEN and LOOP).  The ICLD check was removed from PHASEF, a numerical
discrepancy was corrected in DPRFPA, a correction for frequency 0. cm-1
was added to BMOD, an indexing problem was correct in SOLZEN, and I do
not remember off hand what the change to LOOP is.

     I hope to send corrections to HYPERMOD later today.  It will include
a new read file along with the option to into solar geometry parameters
